id: flash-input-cover
section: Flash
item: With the keyboard up a movie it would cover moves so that its play area stays on the screen, and stage coordinates still land right
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2&layout=low
kit: cavekit-flash.md R5
wait text ready stage= 30
dtap 240 682
expect keyboard up
wait line "the movie moved" 8
wait settled 5
header-away
expect above-keyboard m
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
expect flash-at 200 150 3
